<title>UK: Rushmoor Housing sets 53 million sterling bond.</title>
<headline>Rushmoor Housing sets 53 million sterling bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Banque Paribas and Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RUSHMOOR HOUSING ASSOCIATION</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  AMBAC INSURANCE UK LTD  AMT    53 MLN STG    COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *24.APR.27</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    24.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+72 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT GILT DUE 2021</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     *AMORTISES FROM 2012</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
